        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Jak and Daxter: The Precursor Legacy is a 2001 platform video game developed by Naughty Dog and published by Sony Computer Entertainment for the Sony PlayStation 2 on December 4, 2001, as the first game of the Jak and Daxter series. The game follows the protagonist, a young teenager named Jak, as he tries to help his friend Daxter after he is transformed into an \"ottsel\", a fictional hybrid of an otter and a weasel.\n\nThe game offers a large range of missions, collectables and objectives, often in the form of minigames, which provide a variety of gameplay experiences, as well as puzzles and platforming stages, which are completed by the player to proceed with the story.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Jak and Daxter: The Precursor Legacy es un videojuego de plataformas de 2001 desarrollado por Naughty Dog y publicado por Sony Computer Entertainment para PlayStation 2 el 4 de diciembre de 2001, como primer juego de la serie Jak and Daxter. El juego sigue al protagonista, un joven adolescente llamado Jak, que intenta ayudar a su amigo Daxter después de que este se transforma en un \"ottsel\", una criatura ficticia híbrida de nutria y comadreja.\n\nEl juego ofrece una gran variedad de misiones, coleccionables y objetivos, a menudo en forma de minijuegos, que brindan experiencias de juego diversas, así como rompecabezas y fases de plataformas que el jugador debe completar para avanzar en la historia.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2001",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
